infographic sequence-ascending-steps
data
  title The disaster recovery ladder
  desc Each rung keeps more of the recovery site running to shorten RTO
  order asc
  sequences
    - label Backup and restore
      desc Only data is copied off-site. Rebuild everything on disaster. RTO hours.
    - label Pilot light
      desc Data replicated live, compute off. Scale up on disaster. RTO tens of minutes.
    - label Warm standby
      desc Scaled-down full copy already serving. Scale out on disaster. RTO minutes.
    - label Multi-site active-active
      desc Every region serves real traffic. Losing one is a failover. RTO near zero.
theme
  palette #14b8a6 #f59e0b #f97316 #f43f5e
